<doc id="130325" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=130325" title="Daeng Harris">
Daeng Harris

Daeng Harris (lair ing &lt;a href="Makassar"&gt;Makassar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="10%20Agustus"&gt;10 Agustus&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1911"&gt;1911&lt;/a&gt; - surud ing &lt;a href="Jakarta"&gt;Jakarta&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="12%20Desember"&gt;12 Desember&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1990"&gt;1990&lt;/a&gt;) ya iku paraga lan sutradhara filem Indonésia. Tekan taun &lt;a href="1951"&gt;1951&lt;/a&gt;, dhèwèké wis ngrampungaké 21 filem lan kasil misuwuraké jenengé ing jagad kumidhi ing &lt;a href="Kuala%20Lumpur"&gt;Kuala Lumpur&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika mangsa jawané filem Malaysia, dhèwèké minangka paraga baku paling kondhang kapindho sawusé P. Ramlee. Film-filem sing dibintangi kaya ta &lt;a href="Ibu%20Bidjaksana"&gt;Ibu Bidjaksana&lt;/a&gt; (1939), &lt;a href="Seruan%20Merdeka"&gt;Seruan Merdeka&lt;/a&gt; (1946), &lt;a href="One%20Night%20in%20Singapore"&gt;One Night in Singapore&lt;/a&gt; (1947), &lt;a href="Pisau%20Beratjun"&gt;Pisau Beratjun&lt;/a&gt; (1948), &lt;a href="Dewi%20Moerni"&gt;Dewi Moerni&lt;/a&gt;(1949), &lt;a href="Takdir%20Ilahi"&gt;Takdir Ilahi&lt;/a&gt;(1949), &lt;a href="Manusia%20Iblis"&gt;Manusia Iblis&lt;/a&gt; (1950), &lt;a href="Aloha"&gt;Aloha&lt;/a&gt; (1950), &lt;a href="Pulau%20Mutiara"&gt;Pulau Mutiara&lt;/a&gt;(1950), lan &lt;a href="Radja%20Sehari"&gt;Radja Sehari&lt;/a&gt; (1951). Taun &lt;a href="1954"&gt;1954&lt;/a&gt;, dhèwèké bali menyang &lt;a href="Jakarta"&gt;Jakarta&lt;/a&gt; lan main ana ing filem &lt;a href="Hang%20Tuah%20%28filem%29"&gt;Hang Tuah&lt;/a&gt; sing prodhuseré gabungan prodhuser Indonesia lan Malaysia. Saliyané minangka paraga filem, dhèwèké uga tau minangka sutradhara kanggo filem &lt;a href="Setan%20Kuburan"&gt;Setan Kuburan&lt;/a&gt; (1975).
