Mile Jedinak

Michael John "Mile" Jedinak (lair &lt;a href="3%20Agustus"&gt;3 Agustus&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1984"&gt;1984&lt;/a&gt;;umuré 32 taun) ya iku juru main &lt;a href="bal-balan"&gt;bal-balan&lt;/a&gt; profésional sing dekné teko &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;. Nomor punggungé ya iku 15. Saiki areké dikontrak karo &lt;a href="Crystal%20Palace%20F.C."&gt;Crystal Palace&lt;/a&gt;. Dekné kanthi reguler main kanggo &lt;a href="Tim%20nasional%20bal-balan%20Australia"&gt;Tim nasional Australia&lt;/a&gt;, ndhik ndi dekné main punjol teko bermain lebih teko ping 47 kanggo negarané. Areké dadi kapten kapindonè &lt;a href="Crystal%20Palace%20F.C."&gt;Crystal Palace&lt;/a&gt; karo &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;. Biasanè Mile dadi glandhang sing onok ndék pertahanan. Sadurungé main ndhik &lt;a href="Crystal%20Palace%20F.C."&gt;Crystal Palace F.C.&lt;/a&gt; Mile main ndhik &lt;a href="Varteks"&gt;Varteks&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Central%20Coast%20Marinirs"&gt;Central Coast Marinirs&lt;/a&gt; taun 2006. Sakbaré kui areké main ndhik &lt;a href="Genclerbirligi"&gt;Genclerbirligi&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Antalyaspor"&gt;Antalyaspor&lt;/a&gt;. Mile uga masuk pratélan 50 juru main bal-balan sing apik ndhik &lt;a href="Asia"&gt;Asia&lt;/a&gt; versi majalah &lt;a href="FourFourTwo"&gt;FourFourTwo&lt;/a&gt;.
