<doc id="131976" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=131976" title="Aming Aminoedin">
Aming Aminoedin

Aming Aminoedin, aliyasé &lt;a href="Mohammad%20Amir%20Tohar"&gt;Mohammad Amir Tohar&lt;/a&gt;(lair ing &lt;a href="Ngawi"&gt;Ngawi&lt;/a&gt;, 22 Dhésèmber 1957) ya iku pengarang sastra Jawa modèrn. Pawiyatan SD tumeka SMA dirampungake ing kutha klairané. Wondéné gelar sarjana olèh saka jurusan &lt;a href="Bahasa%20lan%20Sastra%20Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Bahasa lan Sastra Indonésia&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Fakultas%20Sastra"&gt;Fakultas Sastra&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Univ%C3%A8rsitas%20Sew%C3%A9las%20Maret%20Surakarta"&gt;Univèrsitas Sewélas Maret Surakarta&lt;/a&gt; (UNS). Dhèwèké ngrampungaké kuliah kurang saka 10 taun. 
Kawitané dhèwèké makaryo ing Kantor Wilayah Departemèn Pendidikan dan Kebudayaan Provinsi &lt;a href="Jawa%20Timur"&gt;Jawa Timur&lt;/a&gt;. Saiki dhèwèké kinarya tenaga peneliti lan pembina sastra ing &lt;a href="Balai%20Bahasa%20Surabaya"&gt;Balai Bahasa Surabaya&lt;/a&gt;. Éwadéné dhèwèké luwih akèh nyemplung ing jagad sastra Indonésia, nanging prihatiné ing sastra Jawa cukup gedhé. 
Karya-karyané terbit ing akèh médhia massa lan antologi (bebarengan). Kaya ta &lt;a href="%27%27%26quot%3BNgenget%26quot%3B%27%27"&gt;"Ngenget"&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="%27%27%26quot%3BWajah%20Bertiga%26quot%3B%27%27"&gt;"Wajah Bertiga"&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="%27%27%26quot%3BTanah%20Persada%26quot%3B%27%27"&gt;"Tanah Persada"&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="%27%27%26quot%3BKonstruksi%20Roh%26quot%3B%27%27"&gt;"Konstruksi Roh"&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="%27%27%26quot%3BBurung-Burung%26quot%3B%27%27"&gt;"Burung-Burung"&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="%27%27%26quot%3BSketsa%20Sastra%20Indon%C3%A9sia%26quot%3B%27%27"&gt;"Sketsa Sastra Indonésia"&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="%27%27%26quot%3BPuisi%20Indon%C3%A9sia%26quot%3B%27%27"&gt;"Puisi Indonésia"&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="%27%27%26quot%3BLangkah%2C%20Jejak%26quot%3B%27%27"&gt;"Langkah, Jejak"&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="%27%27%26quot%3BOmongo%20Apa%20Wa%C3%A9%26quot%3B%27%27"&gt;"Omongo Apa Waé"&lt;/a&gt;. Guritané &lt;a href="%27%27%26quot%3BKutha%20Surabaya%26quot%3B%27%27"&gt;"Kutha Surabaya"&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="%27%27%26quot%3BTanpa%20Mripat%26quot%3B%27%27"&gt;"Tanpa Mripat"&lt;/a&gt; kalebu ing antologi (PPSJS, 2001), éwadéné &lt;a href="%27%27%26quot%3BTanpa%20Mripat%26quot%3B%27%27"&gt;"Tanpa Mripat"&lt;/a&gt; terbit ana &lt;a href="%27%27Drona%20Gugat%27%27"&gt;Drona Gugat&lt;/a&gt; (dudu Panitia Parade Seni W.R. Supratman, 1955).

